Class Names ---> PascalCase

Method Names ---> camelCase

Variable Name ---> camelCase

Constants ---> UPPER_CASE
        eg---> public static final int MAX_RETRY = 3

Package Name ---> lowercase

Interface Names ---> PascalCase



Method Naming --->
        Use verb + intent

boolean naming --->
is,has,can etc always sound like question

Avoid Magic numbers

Proper Exception Naming --->
    UserNotFoundException
    PaymentFailedException

We use enums to avoid magic strings